{"unit_id":"agent-mobile__dsh-speech#card-zh","repo":"agent-mobile/dsh-speech","commit":"008b06fa0e181a9de01e69af38988fe8c7733c9c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-speech（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH Web 增加语音识别、语音合成和实时转录。它通过 webServer 扩展点挂载受令牌保护的 HTTP API、实时 WebSocket 通道和配置页面。主要功能包括批量音频转文字、文本转语音、实时语音转录以及在 DashScope、OpenAI 兼容服务、本地中继和流式 WebSocket 提供商间配置选择。适合需要从 DSH Web 或配套客户端调用语音能力的用户。使用时需配置访问令牌，并按所选提供商设置服务地址和凭证。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:28-56","src/route.ts:90-120","src/session/channel.ts:50-80"]}
{"unit_id":"agent-mobile__dsh-speech#card-en","repo":"agent-mobile/dsh-speech","commit":"008b06fa0e181a9de01e69af38988fe8c7733c9c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-speech adds speech recognition, synthesis, and live transcription to DSH Web via token-gated HTTP and WebSocket routes. It supports configurable cloud and local providers. Configure an access token plus the endpoint and credentials for the selected provider.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:28-56","src/route.ts:90-120","src/session/channel.ts:50-80"]}
